!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Start;
:Obtain raw material from received list;
:v1: Is raw material available in stock? ({Yes-check, Yes-proceed, No}); <<objectSignal>>
switch ()
case ([v1 = "No"])
:Is raw material available in stock?;
:Select a supplier;
:Send material purchase order;
:proceed to check the raw material and conclude the process;
case ([v1 = "Yes-proceed"])
case ([v1 = "Yes-check"])
:check the raw material and conclude the process;
:end the process;
endswitch
